      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow6:109",
        "answer": "Takes menu f1_arg0, controller f1_arg1 and eight layout bounds f1_arg2..f1_arg9; calls LUI.UIElement.new and sets the literal class/id/sound. Creates two identically positioned light-gray spawn-info-line images. The second receives ui_add. Both are added/published in order; the selected body has no spawn decision, callback or explicit close hook. Exact child order: SpawnInfoLine, SpawnInfoLineAdd. All layout/property/asset values and each callback body are retained in the ordered trace. Calls the optional same-file-or-unresolved PostLoadFunc at its exact source position, then returns self; a same name in another file supplies no binding. Base/child lifetime, model/event/animation delivery and native asset behavior remain external unless a reused exact provider contract explicitly supplies the bounded fact.",
